@Host = http://localhost:5050

### Health Check
GET {{Host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Proxy to Products Service
GET {{Host}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token_here>
Accept: application/json

### Proxy to Invoicing Service
GET {{Host}}/api/invoices
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token_here>
Accept: application/json
